"default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-07-10T21:35:23Z","updated_at":"2025-11-24T16:28:05Z","closed_at":"2025-11-24T16:28:00Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in Godot 4.4.1 and previous versions. The code implementing the bbcode to markdown conversion in the LSP has not changed over the past 6 years.\n\n### System information\n\nLinux Pop!_OS 22.04 LTS 64-bit\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn the GDScript language server, the conversion of bbcode to markdown is incomplete and leads to docstrings not rendering well in external code editors.\n\nScreenshot from the MRP, with a docstring showing up in Zed:\n\n<img width=\"2191\" height=\"1022\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ff45c388-5728-4efd-9a29-2ce7c0af8f76\" />\n\nIn VSCode docstrings appear fine, but that's because the VSCode extension cleans up the invalid markdown sent by the GDScript language server: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-vscode-plugin/blob/45db62bfa312b820548ef7d12be18e8caf4214c1/src/lsp/GDScriptLanguageClient.ts#L224-L247\n\nInstead, this should be addressed in core because:\n\n1. Every external editor plugin would need to implement the fix individually\n2. There are still edge cases left and supported bbcode tags not handled, neither in the editor or the plugin\n3. Actually, in some editors like Zed, I think right now it's not even possible to intercept and process language server RPC messages freely in extensions; language server features and fixes are expected to be made upstream in the language servers themselves\n\nHolonProduction was so kind to point me to the code converting the bbcode, which is located here: https://github.com/HolonProduction/godot/blob/53be3b78d1634406f1fb29e3802c608a5f5104a1/modules/gdscript/language_server/godot_lsp.h#L1941-L1991\n\nI'll follow the issue with a draft pull request.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open an external editor like Zed that connects to the GDScript language server\n- Hover over a project symbol with a docstring including bbcode formatting, including tags like [br], [codeblock lang=gdscript], [color=red], etc. (basic formatting like bold or italics works fine)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[bbcode_docstrings_MRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21171363/bbcode_docstrings_MRP.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108496/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108496/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}